config APP_VKMARK
	bool "vkmark Vulkan benchmark substrate port"
	default n
	select LIBUKVIRTIO_GPU
	select LIBUKSGLIST
	select LIBUKVULKAN_VENUS
	help
	  vkmark Vulkan benchmark ported to Unikraft as a Venus driver substrate
	  proof. vkmark is an open-source Vulkan benchmarking tool that exercises
	  scenes similar to glmark2 but using the Vulkan API instead of OpenGL ES.
	  Upstream: https://github.com/vkmark/vkmark
	  Uses the native Venus Vulkan driver (libukvulkan_venus) over
	  libukvirtio_gpu to open a Venus/Vulkan context, enumerate 10 scenes, and
	  document the blocked rendering path (requires the Venus command encoder
	  for fps evidence).
	  Evidence row: gfx.vkmark (pass-substrate: Venus driver open + scene
	  enumeration).
